.TH SHADERCANDY-SCREENSAVER 1 "2026-09-20" "ShaderCandy 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shadercandy-screensaver \- GPU-accelerated procedural screensaver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shadercandy-screensaver
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ShaderCandy
is a GPU-accelerated screensaver that renders real-time procedural shaders
using OpenGL. It supports X11/XScreenSaver integration, multi-display setups,
audio reactivity, hot-reload, and configurable transitions between shaders.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-shader " name"
Start with a specific shader.
.TP
.BI \-shader\-dir " path"
Add a shader directory to search.
.TP
.BI \-window\-id " id"
Run inside an existing X11 window (XScreenSaver mode).
.TP
.B \-root
Render on the root window.
.TP
.B \-audio
Enable audio reactivity via microphone/system audio.
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
Show usage information.
.SH KEYBOARD CONTROLS
.TP
.B Right Arrow / Space / P
Next shader.
.TP
.B Left Arrow / N
Previous shader.
.TP
.B S
Toggle shuffle mode.
.TP
.B F
Toggle current shader as favorite.
.TP
.B X
Skip current shader (add to skip list).
.TP
.B E
Cycle easing mode.
.TP
.B Shift+T
Cycle transition type.
.TP
.B 1\-5
Adjust shader parameters.
.TP
.B Ctrl+S / Ctrl+O
Save / load preset.
.TP
.B Tab
Cycle multi-monitor display target.
.TP
.B D
Toggle debug overlay.
.TP
.B F12 / PrintScreen
Take screenshot (PPM format).
.TP
.B ESC / Q / Ctrl+Q
Quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/shadercandy/
Configuration and preset directory.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/shadercandy/shaders/
User shader directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shadercandy-player (1),
.BR shadercandy-wallpaper (1),
.BR shadercandy-wayland (1)
.SH AUTHORS
ShaderCandy contributors.
